# Camera credentials
# Location: /Users/jill/farm-surveillance/camera-creds.env
#
# Conventions (2026-07-24 RLC-510A swap, 2026-07-29 camera retirement):
#   - Every camera has a `_IP` env var. RTSP URLs are kept for the
#     actual streaming connection; `_IP` is the source of truth for
#     camera identity, audit logs, and any code that needs the IP
#     without parsing the RTSP URL.
#   - `_IP` and the host inside `_RTSP_URL` must agree at all times;
#     runtime sanity check in frame_capture.load_camera_creds warns if
#     they diverge.
#   - As of 2026-07-29: Building Back Solar and Building Front Corner
#     have been physically removed. See docs/CLEANUP-2026-07-29-RETIRED-CAMERAS.md.

# ── Front Corner Inside (192.168.1.39) ──────────────────────────────────────
FRONT_IP=192.168.1.39
FRONT_HTTP_USER=admin
FRONT_HTTP_PASS=#wijhVV2OFt69@Z#tG
FRONT_RTSP_USER=admin
FRONT_RTSP_PASS=#wijhVV2OFt69@Z#tG
FRONT_RTSP_URL=rtsp://admin:%23wijhVV2OFt69@Z%23tG@192.168.1.39:554/

# ── Back Door Inside (192.168.1.85) ────────────────────────────────────────
